\f368\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'e1o thanh to\'e1n t\u7893\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7875\'3f ch\u7913\'3fng minh. Sau khi ki\u7875\'3fm so\'e1t \'f0\u7889\'3fi chi\u7871\'3fu v\'e0 x\'e1c  nh\u7853\'3fn b\'e1o c\'e1o thanh to\'e1n t
\u7893\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp, S\u7903\'3f, Ty  t\'e0i ch\'ednh ho\'e0n l\u7841\'3fi cho S\u7903\'3f, Ty ch\u7911\'3f qu\u7843\'3fn nh\u7919\'3fng gi\u7845\'3fy n\u7897\'3fp ti\u7873\'3fn v\'e0 nh\u7919\'3fng bi\'ean lai \'f0}{
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'e3 thu h\u7891\'3fi }{\f368\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'f0\u7875\'3f S\u7903\'3f, Ty ch\u7911\'3f qu\u7843\'3fn l\'fdu tr\u7919\'3f b\u7843\'3fo qu\u7843\'3fn theo \'f0\'fang ch\u7871
\'3f \'f0\u7897\'3f}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683  ch\u7913\'3fng t\u7915\'3f k\u7871\'3f to\'e1n.
\par }{\f368\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 d) Gi\u7919\'3fa c\'f5 quan, \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f tr\u7921\'3fc thu\u7897\'3fc trung \'fd\'f5ng v\u7899\'3fi S\u7903\'3f, Ty t\'e0i ch\'ednh
\par - N\u7871\'3fu c\'f5 quan tr\u7921\'3fc thu\u7897\'3fc trung \'fd\'f5ng nh\u7853\'3fn bi\'ean lai t\u7915\'3f S\u7903\'3f, Ty t\'e0i ch\'ednh r\u7891\'3fi ph\'e2n ph\u7889\'3fi l\u7841\'3fi cho c\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f c\u7845\'3fp d\'fd\u7899\'3fi s
\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng th}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'ec nh\u7919\'3fng }{\f368\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f n\'e0y ph\u7843\'3fi thanh to\'e1n  v\u7899\'3fi c\'f5 quan c\u7845\'3fp tr\'ea
n nh\'fd \'f0}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'e3 quy }{\f368\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'f0\u7883\'3fnh \u7903\'3f \'f0i\u7875\'3fm b n\'f3i tr\'ean. C\'f5 quan tr\u7921\'3fc thu\u7897\'3fc trung \'fd\'f5ng s\u7869
\'3f t\u7893\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp v\'e0 thanh to\'e1n v\u7899\'3fi S\u7903\'3f, Ty t\'e0i ch\'ednh nh\'fd \'f0}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'e3 quy }{\f368\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'f0\u7883\'3fnh \u7903\'3f \'f0i
\u7875\'3fm c n\'f3i tr\'ean. 
\par - N\u7871\'3fu c\'f5 quan tr\u7921\'3fc thu\u7897\'3fc trung \'fd\'f5ng kh\'f4ng c\'f3 \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f c\u7845\'3fp d\'fd\u7899\'3fi, tr\u7921\'3fc ti\u7871\'3fp s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng bi\'ean lai \'f0\u7875\'3f thu ti\u7873\'3f}{
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 n ph\u7841\'3ft th\'ec c\u361\'75ng thanh to\'e1n v\u7899\'3fi S\u7903\'3f, Ty t\'e0i ch\'ednh nh}{\f368\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'fd \'f0}{
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'e3 quy }{\f368\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'f0\u7883\'3fnh \u7903\'3f  \'f0i\u7875\'3fm b n\'f3i tr\'ean. Sau khi ki\u7875\'3fm so\'e1t, \'f0\u7889\'3fi chi\u7871\'3fu v\'e0 x\'e1c nh
\u7853\'3fn b\'e1o c\'e1o thanh to\'e1n, S\u7903\'3f, Ty t\'e0i ch\'ednh c\u361\'3fng ho\'e0n l\u7841\'3fi gi\u7845\'3fy n\u7897\'3fp ti\u7873\'3fn v\'e0 nh\u7919\'3fng bi\'ean lai \'f0}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'e3 thu h\u7891
\'3fi }{\f368\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'f0\u7875\'3f c\'f5 quan tr\u7921\'3fc thu\u7897\'3fc trung \'fd\'f5ng l\'fdu tr\u7919\'3f, b\u7843\'3fo qu\u7843\'3fn nh\'fd c\'e1c ch\u7913\'3fng t\u7915\'3f k\u7871\'3f to\'e1n.
\par - Trong m\u7885\'3fi tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp, ph\u7843\'3fi \'f0\u7843\'3fm b\u7843\'3fo nguy\'ean t\u7855\'3fc l\'e0: c\'f5 quan, \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f tr\u7921\'3fc thu\u7897\'3fc trung \'fd\'f5ng \'f0}{
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'e3 nh\u7853\'3fn bi\'ean lai t\u7915\'3f S\u7903\'3f, Ty t\'e0i ch\'ednh n\'e0o th\'ec ph\u7843\'3fi thanh to\'e1n v\u7899\'3fi S\u7903\'3f, Ty }{\f368\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'f0
\'f3 v\'e0 g\u7917\'3fi m\u7897\'3ft b\u7843\'3fn b\'e1o c\'e1o thanh to\'e1n v\u7873\'3f B\u7897\'3f ch\u7911\'3f qu\u7843\'3fn \u7903\'3f trung \'fd\'f5ng \'f0\u7875\'3f theo d}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'f5i, ki\u7875\'3f
m tra khi c\u7847\'3fn thi\u7871\'3ft.
\par }\pard\plain \s2\qc \li0\ri0\keepn\widctlpar\tx0\tx270\faauto\outlinelevel1\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid13126612 \b\f59\fs20\cf2\lang3081\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp3081\langfenp1033 {\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 III. THO\'c1I THU TI
\u7872\'3fN PH\u7840\'3fT VI C\u7842\'3fNH}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 
\par }\pard\plain \qj \fi567\li0\ri0\sb120\sa120\sl-320\slmult0\widctlpar\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid13573986 \f36\fs26\lang3081\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp3081\langfenp1033 {\f368\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 Theo \'f0i\u7873\'3f
u l\u7879\'3f x\u7917\'3f ph\u7841\'3ft vi c\u7843\'3fnh, ng\'fd\u7901\'3fi b\u7883\'3f ph\u7841\'3ft \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc quy\u7873\'3fn khi\u7871\'3fu n\u7841\'3fi l\'ean Th\u7911\'3f tr\'fd\u7903\'3fng \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f c\u7911\'3fa ng\'fd\u7901\'3f
i c\'e1n b\u7897\'3f, chi\u7871\'3fn s\u7929\'3f \'f0}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'e3 ph\u7841\'3ft ho\u7863\'3fc khi\u7871\'3fu n\u7841\'3fi l\'ean Th\u7911\'3f tr}{\f368\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'fd\u7903\'3f
ng c\'f5 quan tr\'ean m\u7897\'3ft c\u7845\'3fp c\u7911\'3fa ng\'fd\u7901\'3fi c\'e1n b\u7897\'3f, chi\u7871\'3fn s\u7929\'3f \'f0\'f3.
\par Vi\u7879\'3fc khi\u7871\'3fu n\u7841\'3fi v\u7873\'3f s\u7889\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn ph\u7841\'3ft \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc x\u7917\'3f l}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'fd nh}{\f368\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'fd sau:
\par }\pard\plain \s17\qj \fi567\li0\ri0\sb120\sa120\sl-320\slmult0\widctlpar\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid13573986 \f36\fs24\cf2\lang3081\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp3081\langfenp1033 {\f368\fs28\cf0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 1. Khi ng\'fd
\u7901\'3fi c\'f3 th\u7849\'3fm quy\u7873\'3fn quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh b\'e1c b\u7887\'3f vi\u7879\'3fc khi\u7871\'3fu n\u7841\'3fi t\u7913\'3fc l\'e0 duy\u7879\'3ft y m\u7913\'3fc ti\u7873\'3fn \'f0}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 
\'e3 ph\u7841\'3ft tr}{\f368\fs28\cf0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'fd\u7899\'3fc \'f0\'e2y th}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'ec ph\u7843\'3fi c\'f4ng b\u7889\'3f quy\u7871\'3ft }{\f368\fs28\cf0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'f0
\u7883\'3fnh \'f0\'f3 v\'e0 gi\u7843\'3fi th\'edch cho ng\'fd\u7901\'3fi b\u7883\'3f ph\u7841\'3ft \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc r}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'f5. Tu}{\f368\fs28\cf0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \u7923\'3f tr\'fd\u7901\'3f
ng h\u7907\'3fp m\'e0 c\'f4ng b\u7889\'3f mi\u7879\'3fng n\u7871\'3fu ng\'fd\u7901\'3fi b\u7883\'3f ph\u7841\'3ft khi\u7871\'3fu n\u7841\'3fi mi\u7879\'3fng; ho\u7863\'3fc b\u7857\'3fng v\'e3n b\u7843\'3fn, c\'f3 ch\u7919\'3f k}{
\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'fd v\'e0 }{\f368\fs28\cf0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'f0\'f3ng d\u7845\'3fu ch\'ednh th\u7913\'3fc n\u7871\'3fu ng\'fd\u7901\'3fi b\u7883\'3f ph\u7841\'3ft c\'f3 \'f0\'f5n khi\u7871\'3fu n\u7841\'3f
i ch\'ednh th\u7913\'3fc.
\par }\pard\plain \qj \fi567\li0\ri0\sb120\sa120\sl-320\slmult0\widctlpar\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid13573986 \f36\fs26\lang3081\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp3081\langfenp1033 {\f368\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 2. Khi ng\'fd\u7901
\'3fi c\'f3 th\u7849\'3fm quy\u7873\'3fn quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh mi\u7877\'3fn ph\u7841\'3ft ho\'e0n to\'e0n hay gi\u7843\'3fm m\u7913\'3fc ti\u7873\'3fn ph\u7841\'3ft th}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'ec ph\u7843\'3fi th}{
\f368\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 u h\u7891\'3fi bi\'ean lai \'f0}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'e3 giao cho ng}{\f368\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'fd\u7901\'3fi b\u7883\'3f ph\u7841\'3ft tr\'fd
\u7899\'3fc \'f0\'e2y, g\u7841\'3fch ch\'e9o 2 g\u7841\'3fch \u7903\'3f m\u7863\'3ft tr\'fd\u7899\'3fc t\u7901\'3f bi\'ean lai \'f0\'f3 v\'e0 ghi v\'e0o m\u7863\'3ft sau:
\par "Qua xem x\'e9t l\u7841\'3fi s\u7921\'3f vi\u7879\'3fc, quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh mi\u7877\'3fn ho\'e0n to\'e0n s\u7889\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn ph\u7841\'3ft \'f0}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'e3 thu theo bi\'ean lai n\'e0y" (ho
\u7863\'3fc: quy\u7871\'3ft }{\f368\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'f0\u7883\'3fnh gi\u7843\'3fm m\u7913\'3fc ti\u7873\'3fn ph\u7841\'3ft theo bi\'ean lai n\'e0y, thay b\u7857\'3fng bi\'ean lai ph\u7841\'3ft s\u7889\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn l\'e0
........\'f0\u7891\'3fng)
\par Ti\u7871\'3fp \'f0\'f3, ng\'fd\u7901\'3fi c\'f3 th\u7849\'3fm quy\u7873\'3fn ghi ng\'e0y th\'e1ng, k}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'fd t\'ean, }{\f368\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'f0\'f3ng d\u7845\'3fu r\u7891\'3f
i  tr\u7843\'3f l\u7841\'3fi bi\'ean lai n\'e0y cho c\'e1n b\u7897\'3f, chi\u7871\'3fn s\u7929\'3f ho\u7863\'3fc c\'f5 quan \'f0}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'e3 ph\u7841\'3ft }{\f368\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'f0
\u7875\'3f ch\u7845\'3fp h\'e0nh quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh cu\u7889\'3fi c\'f9ng. C\u7909\'3f th\u7875\'3f l\'e0:
\par - N\u7871\'3fu \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc mi\u7877\'3fn ph\u7841\'3ft ho\'e0n to\'e0n: Tr\'edch t\u7915\'3f s\u7889\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn thu n\u7897\'3fp ph\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7875\'3f tr\u7843\'3f l\u7841\'3fi cho \'f0\'fd\'f5ng s\u7921\'3f s\u7889\'3f ti\u7873\'3f
n \'f0}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'e3 ph\u7841\'3ft;
\par }{\f368\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 - N\u7871\'3fu \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc gi\u7843\'3fm m\u7913\'3fc ti\u7873\'3fn ph\u7841\'3ft: l\u7853\'3fp bi\'ean lai kh\'e1c the \'f0\'fang quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh cu\u7889\'3fi c\'f9ng v\'e0 c
\u361\'3fng tr\'edch t\u7915\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn thu n\u7897\'3fp ph\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7875\'3f tr\u7843\'3f l\u7841\'3fi cho \'f0\'fd\'f5ng s\u7921\'3f s\u7889\'3f ch\'eanh l\u7879\'3fch gi\u7919\'3fa s\u7889\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn \'f0}{
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'e3 ph\u7841\'3ft tr}{\f368\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'fd\u7899\'3fc \'f0\'e2y v\u7899\'3fi s\u7889\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn ph\u7841\'3ft theo quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh cu\u7889\'3fi c
\'f9ng;
\par }{\f360\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 - L\u7845\'3fy ch\u7919\'3f k\'fd nh\u7853\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa \'f0}{\f368\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'fd\'f5ng s\u7921\'3f \u7903\'3f g\'f3c d\'fd\u7899\'3fi, b\'ean tr\'e1i, m\u7863
\'3ft sau t\u7915\'3f bi\'ean lai thu h\u7891\'3fi;
\par - X\u7871\'3fp nh\u7919\'3fng t\u7901\'3f bi\'ean lai thu h\u7891\'3fi n\'e0y th\'e0nh t\u7853\'3fp ri\'eang \'f0\u7875\'3f \'f0\'ednh k\'e8m b\'e1o c\'e1o thanh to\'e1n g\u7917\'3fi c\'f5 quan c\u7845\'3fp tr\'ean ho\u7863\'3fc bi\'ean b\u7843\'3f
n thanh to\'e1n g\u7917\'3fi c\'f5 quan t\'e0i ch\'ednh.
\par 3. Vi\u7879\'3fc ch\u7845\'3fp h\'e0nh quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh cu\u7889\'3fi c\'f9ng tr\'ean \'f0\'e2y l\'e0 tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm c\u7911\'3fa c\'f5 quan qu\u7843\'3fn l}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'fd ng}{
\f368\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'fd\u7901\'3fi c\'e1n b\u7897\'3f, chi\u7871\'3fn s\u7929\'3f \'f0}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'e3 x\u7917\'3f ph\u7841\'3ft. Cho n\'ean, kh\'f4ng nh\u7845\'3ft thi\u7871\'3ft b
\u7843\'3fn th\'e2n ng}{\f368\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'fd\u7901\'3fi c\'e1n b\u7897\'3f, chi\u7871\'3fn s\u7929\'3f \'f0\'f3 ph\u7843\'3fi th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh tr\'ean m\'e0 trong tr\'fd\u7901
\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp ng\'fd\u7901\'3fi \'f0\'f3 \'f0}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'e3 b\'e0n giao cho ng}{\f368\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'fd\u7901\'3fi kh\'e1c th\u7915\'3fa h\'e0nh c\'f4ng v\u7909\'3f th}{
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'ec ng}{\f368\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'fd\u7901\'3fi n\'e0y ph\u7843\'3fi gi\u7843\'3fi quy\u7871\'3ft nh\u7919\'3fng c\'f4ng vi\u7879\'3fc c\u7909\'3f th\u7875\'3f \'f0}{
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'e3 n\'f3i \u7903\'3f tr\'ean.
\par }\pard\plain \s2\qc \li0\ri0\keepn\widctlpar\tx0\tx270\faauto\outlinelevel1\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid13126612 \b\f59\fs20\cf2\lang3081\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp3081\langfenp1033 {\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 IV. K\u7870\'3f TO
\'c1N THU, N\u7896\'3fP V\'c0 B\u7842\'3fO QU\u7842\'3fN CH\u7912\'3fNG T\u7914\'3f, BI\'caN LAI}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 
\par }\pard\plain \qj \fi567\li0\ri0\sb120\sa120\sl-320\slmult0\widctlpar\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid13573986 \f36\fs26\lang3081\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp3081\langfenp1033 {\f368\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 1. Sau khi thanh to
\'e1n v\u7899\'3fi c\'e1n b\u7897\'3f, chi\u7871\'3fn s\u7929\'3f tr\u7921\'3fc ti\u7871\'3fp thu ti\u7873\'3fn ph\u7841\'3ft, c\'f5 quan nh\u7853\'3fn }{\f360\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 s\u7889\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn do c\'e1n b\u7897\'3f
, chi\u7871\'3fn s\u7929\'3f \'f0\'f3 giao l\u7841\'3fi, ph\u7843\'3fi t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc ghi ch\'e9p k\u7871\'3f to\'e1n theo c\'e1c quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh sau \'f0\'e2y:
\par }{\f368\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 a) N\u7871\'3fu c\'f5 quan l\'e0 m\u7897\'3ft \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f k\u7871\'3f to\'e1n, \'f0}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'e3 \'e1p d\u7909\'3fng ch\u7871\'3f }{
\f368\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'f0\u7897\'3f k\u7871\'3f to\'e1n \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f d\u7921\'3f to\'e1n (ban h\'e0nh k\'e8m theo quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh s\u7889\'3f 03 TC/TDT ng\'e0y 30/3/1972 c\u7911\'3fa B\u7897\'3f T\'e0
i ch\'ednh) th}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'ec:
\par - Khi nh\u7853\'3fn ti\u7873\'3fn do c\'e1n b\u7897\'3f, chi\u7871\'3fn s\u7929\'3f giao l\u7841\'3fi, ghi:
\par Qu\u7929\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn m\u7863\'3ft N\u7907\'3f
\par     Thanh to\'e1n thu n\u7897\'3fp ng\'e2n s\'e1ch C\'f3
\par }{\f368\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 - Khi thu h\u7891\'3fi bi\'ean lai do ng\'fd\u7901\'3fi b\u7883\'3f ph\u7841\'3ft khi\u7871\'3fu n\u7841\'3fi, t\u7913\'3fc l\'e0 tho\'e1i thu kho\u7843\'3fn ti\u7873\'3fn \'f0}{
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'e3 ph\u7841\'3ft theo bi\'ean lai }{\f368\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'f0\'f3, c\u361\'3fng nh\'fd khi tr\'edch qu\u7929\'3f, \'f0em n\u7897\'3fp s\u7889\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn ph\u7841\'3f
t v\'e0o ng\'e2n s\'e1ch, \'f0\u7873\'3fu ghi:
\par }{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 Thanh to\'e1n thu n\u7897\'3fp ng\'e2n s\'e1ch N\u7907\'3f
\par      Qu\u7929\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn m\u7863\'3ft C\'f3
\par }{\f368\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 b) N\u7871\'3fu c\'f5 quan ch\u7881\'3f l\'e0 m\u7897\'3ft \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f thanh to\'e1n, ch\'fda t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc th\'e0nh \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f k\u7871\'3f to\'e1n, n\'ean \'e1p d\u7909
\'3fng ch\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7897\'3f k\u7871\'3f to\'e1n \'f0\'f5n, th}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'ec ph\u7843\'3fi m\u7903\'3f s\u7893\'3f ghi l\u7847\'3fn l}{\f368\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'fd\u7907\'3ft t
\u7915\'3fng s\u7889\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn do c\'e1n b\u7897\'3f, chi\u7871\'3fn s\u7929\'3f \'f0}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'e3 thu }{\f368\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 v\'e0 \'f0}{
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'e3 tho\'e1i thu. }{\f368\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'d0\u7871\'3fn th\u7901\'3fi h\u7841\'3fn n\u7897\'3fp ti\u7873\'3fn v\'e0o ng\'e2n s\'e1ch ph\u7843\'3fi c\u7897\'3fng nh\u7919\'3f
ng s\u7889\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn \'f0}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'e3 thu, tr\u7915\'3f }{\f368\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'f0i nh\u7919\'3fng s\u7889\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn tho\'e1i thu r\'fat ra s\u7889\'3f th\u7921\'3f
c thu v\'e0 l\'e0m gi\u7845\'3fy n\u7897\'3fp ti\u7873\'3fn, n\u7897\'3fp to\'e0n b\u7897\'3f s\u7889\'3f th\u7921\'3fc thu v\'e0o ng\'e2n s\'e1ch.
\par c) Trong m\u7885\'3fi tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp, d\'f9 l\'e0 \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f k\u7871\'3f to\'e1n hay \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f thanh to\'e1n, s\u7889\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn ph\u7841\'3ft do c\'e1n b\u7897\'3f giao l\u7841\'3fi h\u7857\'3fng ng\'e0y ho
\u7855\'3fc h\u7857\'3fng tu\u7847\'3fn \'f0\u7873\'3fu ph\u7843\'3fi t\u7853\'3fp trung do th\u7911\'3f qu\u7929\'3f c\u7911\'3fa c\'f5 quan gi\u7919\'3f, kh\'f4ng \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc \'f0\u7875\'3f t\u7841\'3fn m\u7841\'3fn m\u7895\'3fi ng\'fd\u7901\'3f
i gi\u7919\'3f m\u7897\'3ft ph\u7847\'3fn, tr\'e1nh m\u7885\'3fi s\'f5 h\u7903\'3f, t\u7893\'3fn th\u7845\'3ft cho c\'f4ng qu\u7929\'3f. D\u297\'3f nhi\'ean, th\u7911\'3f qu\u7929\'3f ph\u7843\'3fi m\u7903\'3f s\u7893\'3f qu\u7929\'3f theo ch\u7871\'3f 
\'f0\u7897\'3f hi\u7879\'3fn h\'e0nh v\'e0 khi \'f0\u7871\'3fn h\u7841\'3fn n\u7897\'3fp ti\u7873\'3fn ph\u7841\'3ft ph\u7843\'3fi tr\'edch t\u7915\'3f t\u7891\'3fn qu\u7929\'3f chung n\'e0y chuy\u7875\'3fn n\u7897\'3fp v\'e0o ng\'e2n s\'e1ch.
\par 2. C\'e1c bi\'ean lai \'f0\u7873\'3fu c\'f3 gi\'e1 tr\u7883\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn t\u7879\'3f n\'ean ch\u7881\'3f khi n\'e0o thu ti\u7873\'3fn ph\u7841\'3ft m\u7899\'3fi ph\'e1t bi\'ean lai ra. Do \'f0\'f3, vi\u7879\'3fc b\u7843\'3fo qu\u7843\'3fn bi\'ea
n lai ph\u7843\'3fi ch\u7863\'3ft ch\u7869\'3f, kh\'f4ng \'f0\u7875\'3f x\u7849\'3fy ra nh\u7847\'3fm l\u7851\'3fn, m\u7845\'3ft m\'e1t, k\u7875\'3f c\u7843\'3f bi\'ean lai ch\'fda s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng, \'f0}{
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'e3 s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng v\'e0 bi\'ean lai }{\f360\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'f0}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'e3 thu h\u7891\'3fi. }{
\f368\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'d0\u7875\'3f b\u7843\'3fo \'f0\u7843\'3fm y\'eau c\u7847\'3fu n\'e0y, ngo\'e0i vi\u7879\'3fc t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc vi\u7879\'3fc giao nh\u7853\'3fn c\'f3 ghi ch\'e9p s\u7893\'3f s\'e1ch c\u7909\'3f
 th\u7875\'3f nh\'fd \'f0}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'e3 n\'f3i \u7903\'3f ph\u7847\'3fn tr\'ean, c\'f4ng vi\u7879\'3fc b\u7843\'3fo qu\u7843\'3fn bi\'ean lai v\'e0 nh\u7919\'3fng ch\u7913\'3fng t\u7915\'3f thanh to\'e1n bi\'ea
n lai c\u361\'75ng ph\u7843\'3fi }{\f368\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn chu \'f0\'e1o, c\u7909\'3f th\u7875\'3f l\'e0:
\par a) C\'e1n b\u7897\'3f S\u7903\'3f, Ty t\'e0i ch\'ednh \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc ph\'e2n c\'f4ng b\u7843\'3fo qu\u7843\'3fn bi\'ean lai, c\'e1n b\u7897\'3f c\'e1c c\'f5 quan \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc gi\u7899\'3fi thi\u7879\'3fu \'f0\u7871\'3fn nh\u7853\'3fn bi\'ea
n lai t\u7841\'3fi S\u7903\'3f, Ty t\'e0i ch\'ednh c\u361\'3fng nh\'fd c\'e1n b\u7897\'3f, chi\u7871\'3fn s\u7929\'3f l\'e0m nhi\u7879\'3fm v\u7909\'3f x\u7917\'3f ph\u7841\'3ft, ho\'e0n to\'e0n ch\u7883\'3fu tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm v\u7873\'3f s\u7889
\'3f bi\'ean lai \'f0}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'e3 }{\f368\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc c\'f5 quan giao cho, ph\'e0i \'f0\u7871\'3fm v\'e0 ki\u7875\'3fm so\'e1t k\u7929\'3f m\u7895\'3fi khi nh
\u7853\'3fn bi\'ean lai t\u7915\'3f c\'f5 quan v\'e0 khi giao l\u7841\'3fi cho c\'f5 quan.
\par b) Thi\u7871\'3fu ho\u7863\'3fc m\u7845\'3ft m\u7897\'3ft t\u7901\'3f bi\'ean lai n\'e0o, ng\'fd\u7901\'3fi c\'f3 tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm ph\u7843\'3fi b\u7891\'3fi ho\'e0n s\u7889\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn theo gi\'e1 tr\u7883\'3f c\u7911\'3fa t\u7901\'3f bi\'ea
n lai \'f0\'f3.
\par }{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 N\u7871\'3fu thi\u7871\'3fu ho\u7863\'3fc m\u7845\'3ft c\'f3 l\'fd do kh\'e1}{\f360\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 ch quan ch\'ednh \'f0\'e1ng th}{
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'ec ph\u7843\'3fi l\u7853\'3fp bi\'ean b\u7843\'3fn ghi r\'f5 s\u7889\'3f l}{\f368\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'fd\u7907\'3fng thi\u7871\'3fu ho\u7863\'3fc m\u7845\'3ft, nguy\'ean nh\'e2
n, c\'f3 \'f0\u7841\'3fi di\u7879\'3fn c\'f5 quan ch\u7913\'3fng ki\u7871\'3fn, x\'e1c nh\u7853\'3fn v\'e0 g\u7917\'3fi cho c\'f5 quan c\u7845\'3fp tr\'ean x\'e9t. C\'f5 quan n\'e0y s\u7869\'3f b\'e0n b\u7841\'3fc, th\u7889\'3fng nh\u7845\'3ft }{
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'fd ki\u7871\'3fn v\u7899\'3fi c}{\f368\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'f5 quan t\'e0i ch\'ednh \'f0\u7891\'3fng c\u7845\'3fp \'f0\u7875\'3f x\u7917\'3f l}{
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'fd trong ph\u7841\'3fm vi tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm c\u7911\'3fa m\'ecnh ho\u7863\'3fc b\'e1o c\'e1o U\u7927\'3f ban nh\'e2n d\'e2n t\u7881\'3fnh, th\'e0nh ph\u7889\'3f x\u7917\'3f l\'fd.
\par }{\f368\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 Vi\u7879\'3fc thi\u7871\'3fu ho\u7863\'3fc m\u7845\'3ft bi\'ean lai x\u7849\'3fy ra \u7903\'3f c\'f5 quan T\'e0i ch\'ednh do U\u7927\'3f ban nh\'e2n d\'e2n t\u7881\'3fnh, th\'e0nh ph\u7889\'3f x\'e9t v
\'e0 quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh.
\par - Vi\u7879\'3fc x\'e9t v\'e0 quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh b\u7891\'3fi ho\'e0n to\'e0n b\u7897\'3f s\u7889\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn tr\u7883\'3f gi\'e1 nh\u7919\'3fng bi\'ean lai thi\u7871\'3fu ho\u7863\'3fc m\u7845\'3ft, b\u7891\'3fi ho\'e0n m\u7897\'3ft ph
\u7847\'3fn hay \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc mi\u7877\'3fn b\u7891\'3fi ho\'e0n ph\u7843\'3fi theo \'f0\'fang ch\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7897\'3f tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm v\u7853\'3ft ch\u7845\'3ft ban h\'e0nh t\u7841\'3fi Ngh\u7883\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh s\u7889\'3f
 49-CP ng\'e0y 9/4/1968 c\u7911\'3fa H\u7897\'3fi \'f0\u7891\'3fng Ch\'ednh ph\u7911\'3f v\'e0 Th\'f4ng t\'fd s\u7889\'3f 128 TT/LB ng\'e0y 24/7/1968 c\u7911\'3fa li\'ean B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh - Lao \'f0\u7897\'3fng - T\u7893\'3fng c\'f4ng \'f0o}{
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'e0n.
\par }{\f368\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 c) Cu\u7889\'3fng bi\'ean lai \'f0}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'e3 s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng, nh\u7919\'3fng t\u7901\'3f bi\'ean lai }{
\f360\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'f0}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'e3 thu h\u7891\'3fi c\'f9ng v\u7899\'3fi nh\u7919\'3fng b\u7843\'3fn l}{\f368\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'fdu b\'e1o c\'e1
o thanh to\'e1n, gi\u7845\'3fy n\u7897\'3fp ti\u7873\'3fn v\'e0o ng\'e2n s\'e1ch, ph\u7843\'3fi l\'fdu \u7903\'3f c\'f5 quan, \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f l\'e0m nhi\u7879\'3fm v\u7909\'3f x\u7917\'3f ph\u7841\'3ft vi c\u7843\'3fnh trong th\u7901\'3fi gian 12 th
\'e1ng; sau \'f0\'f3, ph\u7843\'3fi chuy\u7875\'3fn cho b\u7897\'3f ph\u7853\'3fn l\'fdu tr\u7919\'3f chung c\u7911\'3fa c\'f5 quan. Sau ba   n\'e3m m\u7899\'3fi \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc ti\'eau hu\u7927\'3f.
\par }\pard\plain \s2\qc \li0\ri0\keepn\widctlpar\tx0\tx270\faauto\outlinelevel1\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid11756278 \b\f59\fs20\cf2\lang3081\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp3081\langfenp1033 {\f368\fs28\cf0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 V. \'d0I\u7872\'3f
U KHO\u7842\'3fN THI H\'c0NH}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 
\par }\pard\plain \qj \fi567\li0\ri0\sb120\sa120\sl-320\slmult0\widctlpar\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid13573986 \f36\fs26\lang3081\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp3081\langfenp1033 {\f368\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 1. Th\'f4ng t\'fd n
\'e0y thi h\'e0nh k\u7875\'3f t\u7915\'3f ng\'e0y k}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'fd. Trong qu\'e1 tr\'ecnh thi h\'e0nh, c\'e1c B\u7897\'3f, c\'e1c ng\'e0nh h\u7919\'3fu quan, U\u7927\'3f ban Nh\'e2n d\'e2n c\'e1c t\u7881\'3fnh, th
\'e0nh ph\u7889\'3f v\'e0 c\'e1c S\u7903\'3f, Ty t\'e0i ch\'ednh th\u7845\'3fy c\'f3 kh\'f3 kh}{\f360\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'e3n, tr\u7903\'3f ng\u7841\'3fi }{\f368\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 ho\u7863\'3fc ph\'e1
t hi\u7879\'3fn c\'f3 \'f0i\u7875\'3fm n\'e0o ch\'fda th\'edch h\u7907\'3fp, \'f0\u7873\'3f ngh\u7883\'3f ph\u7843\'3fn \u7843\'3fnh cho B\u7897\'3f t\'e0i ch\'ednh \'f0\u7875\'3f nghi\'ean c\u7913\'3fu b\u7893\'3f sung ho\u7863\'3fc s\u7917\'3fa \'f0
\u7893\'3fi n\u7871\'3fu x\'e9t th\u7845\'3fy c\u7847\'3fn thi\u7871\'3ft.
\par 2. Nh\u7853\'3fn \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc th\'f4ng t\'fd n\'e0y, S\u7903\'3f, Ty t\'e0i ch\'ednh b\'e1o c\'e1o, xin }{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'fd ki\u7871\'3fn U\u7927\'3f ban Nh\'e2n d\'e2n t\u7881\'3fnh ho\u7863\'3fc th\'e0nh ph
\u7889\'3f, t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc ph\u7893\'3f bi\u7871\'3fn ch}{\f368\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 o c\'e1c ng\'e0nh \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc giao quy\u7873\'3fn x\u7917\'3f ph\u7841\'3ft vi c\u7843\'3fnh, k\u7875\'3f c\u7843\'3f c\'e1c 
\'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f tr\u7921\'3fc thu\u7897\'3fc trung \'fd\'f5ng \'f0\'f3ng \u7903\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fa ph\'fd\'f5ng n\u7871\'3fu c\'f3; v\'e0 b\'e0n b\u7841\'3fc bi\u7879\'3fn ph\'e1p thi h\'e0nh \u7903\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fa ph\'fd\'f5ng. T\u7915\'3f
ng ng\'e0nh ch\u7883\'3fu tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm ph\u7893\'3f bi\u7871\'3fn, h\'fd\u7899\'3fng d\u7851\'3fn cho c\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f tr\u7921\'3fc thu\u7897\'3fc v\'e0 \'f0\u7871\'3fn t\u7915\'3fng c\'e1n b\u7897\'3f, chi\u7871\'3fn s\u7929\'3f 
\'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc giao quy\u7873\'3fn h\u7841\'3fn x\u7917\'3f ph\u7841\'3ft vi c\u7843\'3fnh \'f0\u7875\'3f thi h\'e0nh \'f0\'fang, tr\'e1nh m\u7885\'3fi s\'f5 h\u7903\'3f \'f0\u7875\'3f x\u7849\'3fy ra tham \'f4 l\u7907\'3fi d\u7909\'3fng trong khi c
\'e1n b\u7897\'3f v\'e0 c\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f th\u7915\'3fa h\'e0nh nhi\u7879\'3fm v\u7909\'3f. 
\par 3. S\u7903\'3f, Ty t\'e0i ch\'ednh cho in \'f0\u7911\'3f s\u7889\'3f bi\'ean lai c\u7847\'3fn thi\u7871\'3ft theo m\u7851\'3fu v\'e0 khu\'f4n kh\u7893\'3f th\u7889\'3fng nh\u7845\'3ft cho to\'e0n t\u7881\'3fnh ho\u7863\'3fc th\'e0nh ph\u7889\'3f t\u7915
\'3f \'f0\u7847\'3fu n\'e3m 1978, ch\u7853\'3fm nh\u7845\'3ft c\u361\'3fng kh\'f4ng qu\'e1 ng\'e0y 1/4/1978. Trong khi ch\u7901\'3f \'f0\u7907\'3fi in xong s\u7893\'3f bi\'ean lai theo m\u7851\'3fu th\u7889\'3fng nh\u7845\'3ft, c\'f3 th\u7875\'3f t\u7841
\'3fm th\u7901\'3fi s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng bi\'ean lai hi\u7879\'3fn \'f0ang d\'f9ng c\u7911\'3fa c\'f5 quan T\'e0i ch\'ednh, c\'f5 quan Ki\u7875\'3fm  l\'e2m ho\u7863\'3fc c\'f5 quan C\'f4ng an \'f0\u7883\'3fa ph\'fd\'f5ng (n\u7871\'3fu c\'f3), nh\'fd
ng ph\u7843\'3fi do S\u7903\'3f, Ty t\'e0i ch\'ednh t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc qu\u7843\'3fn l}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'fd th\u7889\'3fng nh\u7845\'3ft v\'e0 h}{\f368\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12531145\charrsid12662683 \'fd\u7899\'3f
